{"_id":"6a2ffb1b2204ffbc59e5a8e3","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"XTXm8aIDbRkTXoAck_m3I","description":"# PySpark\n\nPySpark is the Python API for Apache Spark, the distributed data processing engine. It allows Python code to run Spark jobs on clusters, processing datasets at the scale of terabytes. PySpark provides DataFrame and SQL APIs similar to Pandas and integrates with MLlib for distributed machine learning. It is used when data volume exceeds what Dask or a single machine can handle.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"PySpark Tutorials","url":"https://spark.apache.org/docs/latest/api/python/tutorial/index.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb1a"},{"type":"article","title":"PySpark for Beginners: Beyond the Basics","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/pyspark-for-beginners-beyond-the-basics/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb1b"},{"type":"video","title":"PySpark Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wNRjR6Cds5s&list=PL2IsFZBGM_IHCl9zhRVC1EXTomkEp_1zm","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb1c"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:16:11.840Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/XTXm8aIDbRkTXoAck_m3I.md"}